# BuildKit's per-Dockerfile ignore file for images/postmaster/Dockerfile.
# The build context is the repo root (the Dockerfile COPYs scripts/, share/
# and manifests/ from it), so without this file the whole checkout -- .git,
# every untracked file, every other image's build context -- would enter the
# build. Exclude everything, then allow back in only what the Dockerfile
# actually COPYs.
*
!scripts/
!share/
!manifests/
scripts/__pycache__
